From 1ba8491dc7671e743c13f630edba1d07c1fdf844 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tiago Rodrigues <tiago.rodrigues2933@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 18:32:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: comprehensive system audit and bugfixes across all tabs

- Fix overtime being penalized as delay and prevent morning delay wipes in storage.ts
- Fix blank screen in App.tsx when manager switches to minha_aderencia or atestados
- Add dynamic month & year navigation with controls to ScheduleManager
- Make PayrollManager month selector dynamic across competencies
- Align OccurrencesManager default user selection to manager store
- Support escala_modificada and ponto_pendente navigation in NotificationDrawer
- Ensure TRCT PDF store details strictly resolve to employee registered store
